          %p
            %br/
          %p
            Axioms
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi T
                    %mn 3
                  %mo −
                  %msub
                    %mi T
                    %mn 5
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T_3-T_5
            and others require finite topological spaces with 4 to 7 points, and we need to introduce appropriate notation.
          %p
            We give one more reformulation which does not require special notation. A space is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extremally+disconnected"} extremally disconnected
            iff the closure of an open subset is open, or, equivalently, the closures of disjoint open subsets are disjoint.
          %ul
            %li
              %em
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
