          %p A noted above, item (3) is the usual statement of Urysohn lemma, and item (2) is similar but not equivalent to the Tietze extension theorem.
          %h3#ExtremallyDisconnectedSpacesBeingProjective Extremally disconnected spaces being projective
          %p
            The morphism
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi f
